            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step out into the empty void, and repaint reality one voxel at a time with your reality paint gun in-hand. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cthulhu's Cleanup Crew is a relaxing simulation game where you’ve just been hired as the first (and only) employee at the best (and only) Reality Repair Co. in the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs and bring back a variety of levels from beyond the void - from<strong> </strong>a demonic disco arcade to a real-life murder mystery hotel, and slowly uncover the monstrous mishap hiding within each location. Enjoy a peaceful work day with no failstates, no time limits - just you and the infinite nothingness of a broken reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working under a supposedly reformed eldritch horror, you’ll <strong>restore broken realities</strong>, <strong>grow the business</strong> and climb the most horizontal career ladder in existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPAINT REALITY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/4302d0185e091dca2843812421a034a8.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/4302d0185e091dca2843812421a034a8.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/4302d0185e091dca2843812421a034a8.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal and explore voxel environments one trigger-pull at a time. Piece together what was lost and discover what <i><strong>actually </strong></i>caused a mysterious cataclysm that unmade reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reveals itself piece by piece as you restore reality - every block you reveal is a small victory against the infinite nothing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET TO WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/faedffeb5792f075fb8057c229566335.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/faedffeb5792f075fb8057c229566335.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/faedffeb5792f075fb8057c229566335.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your salary from your eldritch employer for reconstructing reality, and cash in your collected items to make a name for yourself in the reality repair business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job you take on has no failstates or time pressures, so you can enjoy your antediluvian antics at your own pace. At Cthulhu’s Reality Repair Co there are no mistakes, only happy little abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE CAREER LADDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/d1d9f1a46e22e0e7eabf707f0a41672b.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/d1d9f1a46e22e0e7eabf707f0a41672b.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/d1d9f1a46e22e0e7eabf707f0a41672b.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your accolades to upgrade your equipment, unlock new tools and improve your efficiency in the reality repair business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Cthulhu's best and only employee, keeping things running is your job. Trust us: you don't want to let the insanity filters clog up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>DISCOVER HORRIFIC SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/0ead26890e2bd85513d605b3283050aa.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/0ead26890e2bd85513d605b3283050aa.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/0ead26890e2bd85513d605b3283050aa.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect office souvenirs, discover artifacts, and find hidden objects in every world you restore. As the level unfolds, you’ll investigate metaphysical accidents and uncover clues to unravel the mysteries behind each lost reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch worlds come to life as you push back the void. Each time you pull the trigger, you're saying 'yes' to existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's beautiful. Also, legally binding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with no fail states or time limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cthulhu's darkly optimistic commentary on everything you reveal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills and climb the Lovecraftian ladder to career success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery in each level, as every world tells a story about what was (and what probably shouldn't have been).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover amorphous horrors beyond mortal comprehension. Also the coffee machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for: Fans of cozy games who also appreciate nameless horrors from beyond the void.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.poster.avif?t=1794235685\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.webm?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/71ceeba2f677ccf7934e55636b530cae.mp4?t=1794235685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step out into the empty void, and repaint reality one voxel at a time with your reality paint gun in-hand. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cthulhu's Cleanup Crew is a relaxing simulation game where you’ve just been hired as the first (and only) employee at the best (and only) Reality Repair Co. in the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs and bring back a variety of levels from beyond the void - from<strong> </strong>a demonic disco arcade to a real-life murder mystery hotel, and slowly uncover the monstrous mishap hiding within each location. Enjoy a peaceful work day with no failstates, no time limits - just you and the infinite nothingness of a broken reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working under a supposedly reformed eldritch horror, you’ll <strong>restore broken realities</strong>, <strong>grow the business</strong> and climb the most horizontal career ladder in existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPAINT REALITY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/4302d0185e091dca2843812421a034a8.poster.a