vel the mysteries behind each lost reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch worlds come to life as you push back the void. Each time you pull the trigger, you're saying 'yes' to existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's beautiful. Also, legally binding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with no fail states or time limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cthulhu's darkly optimistic commentary on everything you reveal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills and climb the Lovecraftian ladder to career success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery in each level, as every world tells a story about what was (and what probably shouldn't have been).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover amorphous horrors beyond mortal comprehension. Also the coffee machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for: Fans of cozy games who also appreciate nameless horrors from beyond the void.</p></li></ul>",
